# Christian Elaigwu Junior — Game Developer Portfolio

A responsive, single-page portfolio website with an ember-inspired visual theme.

## Files
- `index.html` — the complete portfolio website.

## Preview locally
1. Download and extract the ZIP.
2. Open `index.html` in a browser.

No build tools or dependencies are required.

## Before sending this to a recruiter
- Add 3–5 original screenshots or a short gameplay trailer for Ochanya.
- Add a short description of your exact role and what you personally built.
- Include only tools, engines, and programming languages you can confidently discuss.
- Consider adding a second project or a short development breakdown when available.

## Publish it online
You can publish this as a GitHub Pages site by creating a repository, uploading `index.html`, then enabling Pages in the repository settings. Follow GitHub's current Pages documentation for the exact steps.
